WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.142 --> 00:00:01.388
(audience cheering)
Welcome back,

2
00:00:01.388 --> 00:00:02.221
before we say good bye,

3
00:00:02.221 --> 00:00:04.415
we play a quick round of Drewth or Dare.

4
00:00:04.415 --> 00:00:05.870
(suspenseful music playing)

5
00:00:05.870 --> 00:00:07.223
(audience cheering)

6
00:00:07.223 --> 00:00:08.615
That's right, you get to ask me anything

7
00:00:08.615 --> 00:00:09.448
or tell me to do anything.

8
00:00:09.448 --> 00:00:11.367
And today we have Gia Zampella.

9
00:00:12.322 --> 00:00:15.049
(audience cheering)

10
00:00:15.049 --> 00:00:17.400
Thank you so much for being here, Gia.

11
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:19.630
Thank you, I flew in from LA last night.

12
00:00:19.630 --> 00:00:21.393
I think you're familiar.

13
00:00:21.393 --> 00:00:24.923
I am, are you kidding with this valley girl accent, yes?

14
00:00:24.923 --> 00:00:27.383
Gia Drewth or Dare?

15
00:00:27.383 --> 00:00:28.216
Drewth.

16
00:00:28.216 --> 00:00:29.550
Okay. (sighs)

17
00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:32.980
Who is the last person you were stalking,

18
00:00:32.980 --> 00:00:37.453
creeping on social, and did you find anything good?

19
00:00:40.103 --> 00:00:41.375
(audience laughs)

20
00:00:41.375 --> 00:00:43.283
Come on, Drew. (laughs)

21
00:00:43.283 --> 00:00:44.320
Okay, I'm on a dating app

22
00:00:44.320 --> 00:00:46.540 line:15%
and all the men are really creepy and coy.

23
00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:48.500 line:15%
They won't tell you who they are or what they do.

24
00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:50.800 line:15%
And all their Instagram accounts are private.

25
00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:54.136 line:15%
So yes, sometimes I Google their name. (Gia laughs)

26
00:00:54.136 --> 00:00:55.088 line:15%
(audience laughs)

27
00:00:55.088 --> 00:00:56.467
I do a little like, and then I'm like,

28
00:00:56.467 --> 00:00:57.930
"Oh, finally I found the name."

29
00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:00.600
And I just am trying to figure out who they are.

30
00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:03.200
And usually I resent them by the time

31
00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:04.350
I figured out who they are,
(audience laugh)

32
00:01:04.350 --> 00:01:06.667
that they made it this hard.
(Gia laughs)

33
00:01:06.667 --> 00:01:09.420
But yeah, I totally Google guys

34
00:01:09.420 --> 00:01:11.080
on my dating app because I can't figure out

35
00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:13.118
who they are on the dating app.

36
00:01:13.118 --> 00:01:15.010
(audience laughs)
Nice.

37
00:01:15.010 --> 00:01:19.990
And recently one guy I found out owned a bakery.

38
00:01:19.990 --> 00:01:21.610
Another one was a meditator.

39
00:01:21.610 --> 00:01:24.500
Another one was a finance guy.

40
00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:27.390
And I will tell you this and don't feel sorry for me

41
00:01:27.390 --> 00:01:30.300
cause it's just what happens to all of us women out there.

42
00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:32.360
No one has connected with me.
(audience laughs)

43
00:01:32.360 --> 00:01:34.420
It makes me feel like such a loser.

44
00:01:34.420 --> 00:01:35.860
And then you're like, you know what?

45
00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:39.060
It's just hard out there, it's hard for everybody.

46
00:01:39.060 --> 00:01:41.840
It's hard in person, it's hard on dating apps.

47
00:01:41.840 --> 00:01:44.800
It's vulnerable, but you keep trying

48
00:01:44.800 --> 00:01:48.420
and you fill your life up with so much

49
00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:50.730
that it becomes secondary.

50
00:01:50.730 --> 00:01:53.400
I don't think my happiness is on this dating app.

51
00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:56.910
I think a cherry on top to my life at some convenient,

52
00:01:56.910 --> 00:01:59.580
cool, inspiring, unexpected time

53
00:01:59.580 --> 00:02:02.120
might be in there, but it's,

54
00:02:02.120 --> 00:02:03.450
that's all it is.

55
00:02:03.450 --> 00:02:05.270
So does that answer your question Gia?

56
00:02:05.270 --> 00:02:08.550
I think it does, I'm manifesting somebody for you, so

57
00:02:08.550 --> 00:02:10.280
it's gonna happen.
(audience claps)

58
00:02:10.280 --> 00:02:14.080
When you want it, when you want it.

59
00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:17.350
I am desperate in plenty of areas in my life

60
00:02:17.350 --> 00:02:19.430
and dating isn't one of them.

61
00:02:19.430 --> 00:02:20.263
I love that.

62
00:02:20.263 --> 00:02:21.970
Isn't that so refreshing?

63
00:02:21.970 --> 00:02:23.442
Yeah, refreshing.

64
00:02:23.442 --> 00:02:24.654
(audience clapping)

65
00:02:24.654 --> 00:02:26.578
Thank you for this day, this is so fun.

66
00:02:26.578 --> 00:02:28.001
All right, that's all the time we have.

67
00:02:28.001 --> 00:02:31.214
Thank you so much, for choosing to spend your time with us,

68
00:02:31.214 --> 00:02:32.862
Thank you Gia.

69
00:02:32.862 --> 00:02:36.695
We make the show for you, so take it with you.

70
00:02:37.542 --> 00:02:40.792
(upbeat music playing)

